    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-05-29"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-06-14"></period-end>
     <target value="1,5000">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">More 150,000 people were impacted by Cat 4 and 5 wind speed of cyclone Judy and Kevin in 2023. The contingency financing drawn down leveraged response activities through NDMO&apos;s humanitarian partners. A workshop was also conducted in September 2024 as part of the consultation process for risk-informed Guideline development, and was attended by 19 participants from key agencies. Between 2022-2023, the World Bank funded Pacific Resilience Project,- implemented through the South Pacific Communities, also provided training to 35 officials on post disaster recovery planning and risk-informed planning.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="1,2500"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
